PocketSP local resource patch, 2026-11-09:
The bundled 4.2.3 data/emulator.min.js changes the URL expression in checkForUpdates:
- fetch("https://cdn.emulatorjs.org/stable/data/version.json")
+ fetch(window.EJS_pathtodata+"version.json")
This redirects upstream's localhost-only update check to the bundled version
metadata. No core code, input or emulation behavior was modified.
The original unmodified source is included in EmulatorJS-v4.2.3.tar.gz.
Equivalent source change in data/src/emulator.js:181 uses the configured EJS_pathtodata.
